      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Set Defender Fallout debuff to be unresistable in PvP."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Reverted out the change to the Hamidon enhancement \"Enzyme Exposure\"."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fixed Hamidon con color. The Hamidon will no longer con blue to level 50 characters. The Hamidon's actual powers and level are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Claws/Follow Up now displays an icon for the buff it gives."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Warshade pets will now be dismissed when their caster becomes an exemplar, like other pets."
    },
    {
      "category": "Powers",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Siphon Speed now correctly displays a buff icon Game Stability Fixed occasional crash when a Peacebringer changed costumes in Bright Nova or White Dwarf form."
    },
    {
      "category": "Chat",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Fix for bug that could cause chat to go to the incorrect channel after zoning."
    },
    {
      "category": "Chat",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "In Coalition Chat, All Supergroup members can see the channel options. If they are not eligible to change the options, the options are grayed out."
    },
    {
      "category": "UI",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Dragging Inspirations into full Powers slots will no longer delete them."
